      "revised_prompt": "Create a professional brand logo.\n\nCompany/Idea:\nDesign one original ecommerce logo mark for a modern online shopping brand. \nCreate exactly one simple vector logo only. \nUse a single centered symbol with clean geometry, minimal details, flat design, and strong brand identity. \nWhite background, no mockup, no collage, no multiple concepts, no extra text blocks, no scene, no objects, no characters. \nPremium, modern, crisp, balanced, scalable, icon-ready.\n\n\nBrand type: ecommerce\nSymbol idea: shopping bag with upward arrow\nStyle: minimal, modern, premium\nColors: blue and yellow\nText: flicorn\n\nRequirements:\n- Generate EXACTLY ONE logo.\n- Center the logo on a pure white background.\n- No mockups.\n- No business cards.\n- No T-shirts.\n- No wall signs.\n- No multiple logo concepts.\n- No collage.\n- No grid layout.\n- No watermark.\n- No shadows around the page.\n- No realistic objects.\n- No illustrations.\n- No characters.\n- No scenery.\n\nDesign Style:\nLine art\nSingle stroke\nThin outlines\nElegant\n\n\nLogo Guidelines:\n- Professional vector logo\n- Clean geometry\n- Simple memorable symbol\n- Strong visual identity\n- Balanced composition\n- Minimal details\n- Flat vector style\n- Crisp edges\n- High contrast\n- Scalable from favicon to billboard\n- Brand identity quality\n- Modern premium appearance\n\nOutput:\nOne finished logo only.\n"
